          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "mpe bakobima longwa kati na yango : ba-oyo basalaki malamu bakosekwa mpo na kozwa bomoi, kasi ba-oyo basalaki mabe bakosekwa mpo na kozwa etumbu.",
